From: Manish Rangankar <mrangankar@marvell.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 10:33:24 +0530
Subject: scsi: qla2xxx: Add flash block read/write BSG support for 29xx
Patch-mainline: v7.3-rc1
Git-commit: 2efa08b894c6bf2221acdac428c4bfac3c300f9e
References: bsc#1275737

Introduce QL_VND_READ_FLASH_BLOCK and QL_VND_WRITE_FLASH_BLOCK BSG
vendor commands so that userspace tools can perform flash block-level
operations on 29xx adapters via the isp_ops interface.

Signed-off-by: Manish Rangankar <mrangankar@marvell.com>
Signed-off-by: Nilesh Javali <njavali@marvell.com>
Reviewed-by: Hannes Reinecke <hare@kernel.org>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260723050413.3897522-8-njavali@marvell.com
Signed-off-by: Martin K. Petersen (Oracle) <mkp@kernel.org>
Acked-by: Daniel Wagner <dwagner@suse.de>
